- Enforce the constraint that delegators must hold the delegated role in all states where the delegation is active.
Priority 2 (Important improvements): 
- Review all delegation-related transitions to ensure persistent and constructive enforcement of all delegation constraints and Emergency-mode exceptions.
Priority 3 (Optional enhancements): 
- After repairs, add negative and vacuity checks to confirm the fixes do not overconstrain or underconstrain the model.
