Decision: [keep fix / refine/narrow fix / partially revert / escalate to requirement clarification / adjust scope/trace and rerun]
Rationale: [1-2 sentences]

=== VERIFICATION STATUS ===
- Syntax: [OK/Error]
- Baseline: [Satisfiable/Unsatisfiable]
- Combined Model: [Satisfiable/Unsatisfiable]
- Assertions: [Pass/Counterexamples]
- Instances: [Meaningful/Suspicious/N/A]
- Vacuity: [None/Possible/N/A]

=== CONVERGENCE_RECOMMENDATION ===
Status: [TRUE/FALSE]
Reasoning: [Brief justification based on hard metrics + instance quality]

Note: Only include this section if all hard metrics pass (no syntax errors, no counterexamples, all positive runs satisfied).
Recommend TRUE only if:
- Satisfying instances are meaningful and cover key scenarios
- No vacuity or triviality detected
- All requirements appear adequately verified
- No obvious gaps or missing test cases
Recommend FALSE if further refinement needed.

=== REPAIR INSTRUCTIONS ===
[Specific fixes, constraints, and code corrections for RE agent]
[Include exact locations, a brief rationale, and examples when helpful]
[Or "None" if no model changes needed]

