- Rationale: [why this categorization]
[Or "None - assumptions appear sound" if no issues]

=== REQUIREMENT UPDATES ===
[For each justified requirement-level issue:]
- Affected Requirement/Assumption/Constraint: [identifier or description]
- Issue Type: [ambiguity / inconsistency / missing exception / missing requirement / logical gap / unjustified assumption]
- Evidence: [what verification result exposed it]
- Recommended Update: [how the requirement should change]
- Implication: [what behavior, assumption, or verification expectation changes if updated]
[Or "None - no requirement updates justified"]


=== UPDATED USER QUESTIONS ===
[ONLY genuinely new unresolved questions not in existing Q&A]
[Or "None"]

